{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "b233186cc093049ed707a11c6938573955f294726f05e75829fa3d12754cecdd", "ja": "伝わる熱", "zh": "传递的热意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0181e39feffdc9f6e64ef78f64bef1ac16602cd67bb04806df580ecacf4c8213", "ja": "今日は美希と律子の写真撮影。帰り道にて、\n二人は天体公演への、熱い想いを語り合う。\nやがて劇場に帰還した律子は、プロデューサ\nーに報告。留守中のメンバー達の熱い様子を\n聞き、ますますやる気に満ちていく。", "zh": "今天是美希和律子的拍照工作。回去的路上，\n两人畅谈了对天体公演的热烈心情。\n回到剧场后的律子向制作人\n汇报。听到成员们在她不在时也热情高涨的样子，\n她变得越来越干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ec2ebb071ebbcf1bedaea35b91d93d991ed75077a8518a079cc0b19483f8d0e2", "ja": "都内某所、撮影スタジオにて……", "zh": "东京都内某处，摄影棚内……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "7474ade6dbfb6f81134bdfea7ff235a54edb91a926a59edc403fa4723945d8fb", "ja": "えっと……こんなカンジでどうかな？　あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯……这样感觉怎么样？啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1002_camman", "source_sha256": "3700190abfc4b796dac79be2d7a7ca2be7324528b0d7e1b002f4cfeb45105364", "ja": "いいですね！\n秋月さんも、視線、いただいてもいいですか？", "zh": "很好！\n秋月小姐，能请你也看向这边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "ccb67e11b21c832514802403bfa785027a4b065cf298aae420d6eea7fbbbfc98", "ja": "はーい……じゃ、これで。\nいや、もう少し……こう、かな？", "zh": "好——那，就这样吧。\n不，再稍微……这样，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1004_camman", "source_sha256": "41b4f199ea13f1bfccbddb86c74a6cc39cd230c24b063af95e9060459193dcbd", "ja": "あっ、それ素敵です！　いただきです！", "zh": "啊，这真不错！我收下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1005_se", "source_sha256": "7d37269cd3530b9657d1d5a029bdf004162f4d31c7aefdaaf7f0c578d7d3765b", "ja": "パシャッ！　パシャッ！", "zh": "喀嚓！喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "17eabc99ecca86ed7089950d8c9cf350855e68ba839482e535d7f4918804d7d5", "ja": "むー……ミキも、もうちょっと\n違うポーズやっておこうかな？　お願いしますなの～。", "zh": "唔——……美希也再尝试一下\n别的姿势好啦？拜托你咯～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "19a7e30c1d50514ec8d2d1e78c6fa63ffd4782e4d10a7951c1dc676d34c098e9", "ja": "律子、今日の撮影すごかったね。\nセクシーってカンジ！", "zh": "律子，今天的拍摄好厉害呢。\n感觉特别性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "faef7ba658e1c7b279780c333320ee0e9e87a5e10a1d19bcdcb82bc6ba759485", "ja": "律子じゃなくて律子さん。\nあれくらいやらなきゃ、あなたと並べないの。", "zh": "要叫律子小姐。\n不做到那个地步的话，可就没办法和你并肩了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "1aed2787bb34a90455ce6774622fcdf4ede94d25e9d14b2e7c0001cffb6e0bd2", "ja": "ほんと、色々苦労させられるわ。ふふっ。", "zh": "真是让我操了不少心呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "b9f400ff1428c16dba931054c7dcb551f08d622c965cf2e176fc11d7711ab460", "ja": "あはっ。手のかかる子ほどカワイイってカンジ？", "zh": "啊哈～就是那种越让人操心的孩子越可爱的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "2e67fced97537993406be0d828789991f10a296fd8bb66203c5e2cde37b9984b", "ja": "あはは、それ自分で言う台詞じゃないわよ？", "zh": "啊哈哈，这话可轮不到你自己来说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "eee129840017fa98a49c66d08613d8e72b9bf2181e0a7942a1830196ea17a4ae", "ja": "でもミキ、お互いさまって思うな。律子、さんが\n頑張ってると、ミキももうちょっとって思うし。", "zh": "不过美希觉得，这算是彼此彼此吧。律子小姐一努力，美希也会觉得自己得再加把劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "5b1012da103a386f3a944ccf91ea31ff73877a237786033688e08d5af173c12f", "ja": "春香も千早さんもだけどね。\n……あと、劇場のみんなも。", "zh": "春香还有千早小姐也是哦。\n……还有，剧场里的大家也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "e10340e898f2a107092b15adb3d3034cd2928d1f14dcd0570fac090ea87b097a", "ja": "劇場のみんな……。\nふーん。美希もそんな風に思うのね。", "zh": "剧场的大家……。\n哦——美希也会这么想啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "5faf9709634e80cb66f8545831da5a0899d39ab7dac307b0a4c3a090140ccd61", "ja": "……劇場が始まるときにね、{$P$}に\n言ったの。ミキ、カンタンには負けないからね、って。", "zh": "……剧场开演的时候，我对{$P$}说了：“美希才不会轻易认输呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "da7493b493892014612452e4a77c2fce6102717b3c7c7be65d1d3170273514bc", "ja": "だから、今度の公演も、けっこー本気だよ。\n負けたくないし……。あと。", "zh": "所以，这次的公演，我也是相当认真哦。\n我不想输……还有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "ad9758fe1da76b06d07f786f5e3dacd7db1e13c34e811e306d28af3d49431c1c", "ja": "天体公演、ミキも全部大好きだから。", "zh": "天体公演，美希也全都非常喜欢呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "39fa1e9380a03cde3d7558d6816a1ff5c6eaba46524aa3149390b86544f5bcfc", "ja": "そっか……確かにお互いさまかもね。\n私も負けられないって思うし……単純に嬉しいし。", "zh": "这样啊……确实，我们彼此彼此呢。\n我也觉得不能输……单纯就是很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "e34b195fd18f5a1eb2d549332f5fe778de6b7dafcf343242413c51c0c2ede7c2", "ja": "でも、今日はそろそろ充電切れなの～。あふぅ。\n早く帰ろ？　律子、さん。", "zh": "不过，今天也差不多该没电了～。啊呜。\n快点回去吧？律子……小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "c9a74481bd94c5c6ea097716cec32c1d087bbc437868e3966b570fa7e6656c49", "ja": "はいはい。忘れ物ないわね？\nじゃ、スタッフさんたちに挨拶して出ましょう。", "zh": "好好好。没忘带东西吧？\n那就跟工作人员打声招呼再走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1023_null", "source_sha256": "4ecca33e519efd9992749065426a2dbe53ae3dde3af2954df813e7171f4840f0", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ。", "zh": "咚咚，咔哒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "b1d3d82b0d084aea77d3a80614a1ad1c3cc8a1b7b925e8ff12d3a8cfe589b62c", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n私、そろそろ上がらせてもらいますね。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我差不多该先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "625dc0f746b582c580ebf65f1ec49a7275b2d505b3a9ed1390a12c6eb27983f9", "ja": "っと……律子か、お疲れ様。\n今日の撮影どうだった？　美希の様子とか。", "zh": "嗯……是律子啊，辛苦了。\n今天的拍摄怎么样？美希的状态之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "27c76fa46c10c4b7f64270f349ee798178e69c84bff8c70314f2e2e7dddbcaed", "ja": "いい感じでしたよ。\nずっとやる気出してくれてましたし。", "zh": "感觉很不错。\n她一直都很有干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "c4bdcf91d700ca0cb50e8d435a35574f897802f054c0f60f524b0168ab462da3", "ja": "{$P$}の方こそ、どうでしたか？\nなんだか、スーツがよれてますけど。", "zh": "{$P$}那边情况怎么样？\n西装看着都皱巴巴的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "37dd74efaf276d97a05eab40c54eba0ac891354b296069409d013737363f3437", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと亜美と真美のイタズラが、\nいつにも増して凄かったんだ。", "zh": "啊，亜美和真美的恶作剧比平时更夸张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "afc65c567803c79c7cda6f3ab0b3eeccf78019d07ce640c037a10fa76b48dad0", "ja": "ドアからスライムみたいなのが降ってきて、座った椅子\nが急に下がって、PCを起動したらセクシー画像が……", "zh": "从门上掉下来像史莱姆一样的东西，坐下后椅子突然下沉，启动电脑时还出现了性感图片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "6bd05e8fdc23e638ec437612a0b677c99a989e9a5f5065ccc27c412883724328", "ja": "私がいなかったからって、あのふたりは……もう。\nガツンと言わなきゃダメですよ？", "zh": "就因为我不在，那两个人居然……真是的。\n必须得好好说她们一顿才行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7b95d3d0152059eb8a5f235aa15d66432175484230f3c4fa4088f884e2030d0a", "ja": "いや、でも、やる気も凄いんだよ。\nレッスンがきつめでも、イヤな顔一つしないし。", "zh": "话是这么说，不过她们干劲也很足哦。\n就算练习很辛苦，也没有表现出一丝不情愿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d81f834f07776cd786c779c408bb4a73e73ac0c3384f6a36ea5c35fd17858661", "ja": "全体的に、テンションが高い感じなんだよな。\nはしゃいでるって言うか……。", "zh": "总的来说，感觉她整个人都很兴奋。\n该说是在撒欢吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "9845e5f130973eab386c8e440c6103ff79fee66d357cdc9c1ed9de9476792795", "ja": "なるほど。まあ……。\nその理由なら、なんとなくわかります。", "zh": "原来如此。嗯……\n如果是这个原因，我大概能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "1e01cd6d29a4afe6840e6b41a55c1caf1ed9536d62c56dd556e708ce3683dbc8", "ja": "きっと……嬉しいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "一定是……会很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "acfccc3de86e9db5260ad81fe8369edc57d26e02f02019850334d8ead817b950", "ja": "……もしかして、天体公演ができることが？", "zh": "……难道是因为能举办天体公演？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "3f15373d4a2d221a1b85587b1aaf6a0b47f1698e8193439c41a805deafd7f9a1", "ja": "はい。天体公演っていうバトンを、\n劇場のみんなから渡してもらえたことが。", "zh": "是的。剧场的大家把名为“天体公演”的接力棒交给了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "b5c1d431cec236e4e4470044fc7095e1ec0a2bba062a404cfb1260cc42bad031", "ja": "ここができたばかりの頃は、私達がバトンを渡す側だと\n思ってました。でも今回は……受け取ったんです。", "zh": "这里刚建成的时候，我还以为我们才是传递接力棒的人。\n可是这一次……是我们接到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "a95acbd3f234b6317890e4b1a3809d39cd0fb09ec7c88035ca12d8b7689a7c69", "ja": "かわいい後輩達が全員で繋いできた、大切なバトン。\n……そりゃあ張りきりますよ。", "zh": "可爱的后辈们齐心协力传递下来的珍贵接力棒。……那当然得打起精神来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "316033403d2b30972060a143acc248bb5a8a438fbb68e89d124d9b44270c2de0", "ja": "美希も美希なりに、いろいろ感じてるみたいだし。\n私も……やよいも多分、同じ気持ちです。", "zh": "美希似乎也以她自己的方式感受到了各种各样的事情。\n我……还有弥生，大概也是同样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "7d7ed3868e10e6991a49f38f507b0dc19a4bac7f3a9476b3db26da514296a3bf", "ja": "……。わかった、ありがとう。\n亜美と真美に関しては、任せてくれていいよ。", "zh": "……。我知道了，谢谢你。\n亚美和真美的事，就放心交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "bf79193d4004f68e913074833243be2d56eb4535b74aa7573a5fa531aced4d77", "ja": "そうですか？　わかりました。", "zh": "是吗？我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "54c827cfd1549467040d722137f175b629c088cdd881ea9f70460bcb02b54c07", "ja": "そうだ。帰るなら、駅まで送っていこうか。\n少し外の空気を吸いたい気分なんだ。", "zh": "对。要回去的话，我送你到车站吧。\n我想出去呼吸一下外面的空气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1044_009rit", "source_sha256": "1dc956eb554b93254ee81715e23aae35fc6d9781bea08d2fee5fc984c7dbae0d", "ja": "いいんですか？\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えさせてもらおうかな。", "zh": "可以吗？\n那我就恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0324_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_04_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "8dde645703532ef937c718f15b90f87681ae8481bb472004593c337008e3d6d2", "ja": "私も、星空の下をゆっくり歩きたい気分なんです。\n……エスコート、よろしくお願いしますね？　ふふっ。", "zh": "我也正想在星空下慢慢走走。……那就拜托您陪我一起走了？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
